  <item>
    <title>EP7：迎神围炉胶己人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b84c5a05a90dfd0df4a520</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b84c5a05a90dfd0df4a520</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Feb 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><li><p><span>过了元宵年就过了-----</span><strong><span>吗？</span></strong></p></li><li><p><span>答：潮汕人的年可以过一年！</span></p></li><li><p><span>不信？</span></p></li></ul><p><span>那就欢迎收听本期的：迎神围炉胶己人，关于潮汕过年的饮食习俗拜神游神英歌舞的流水式分享（单人主播略显无聊，感谢收听）</span></p><p><strong><span>⏱️时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 年23送神---老爷放春节假了，可真早啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 除夕----12色花从头洗到脚 / 年夜饭的基本款</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> &nbsp;初四----什么？老爷回来上班了，可真快啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> &nbsp;天花板级别的游神节目----双忠文化节，双忠是谁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> &nbsp;大震惊：英歌舞竟然是中原的傩舞演变来的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1486">24:46</a> &nbsp;题外话之令人汗颜的待客之道---过年离谱的酒店价格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> 七样羹----越食越后生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 第三期讲过的阿嫲又返场啦，这次又有什么超神预测</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> &nbsp;初九----玉皇大帝生日，一个字：拜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 潮汕人超长的年</span></p><blockquote><p><strong><span>部分图片展示，均为本人所拍喔</span></strong></p></blockquote><ul><li><p><span>年23拜神</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLOZWTN3o9iF_1CQWJxTjAye6xX.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>饱含血水的血蚶</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWUvNxA-cs3mmFU8EI8T6312YoO.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>糕烧，说得好听是金玉满堂，内核是番薯芋头</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm_8OKPpXiK5RmlVbG9H2Fzlc-v0.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>英歌队</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh_eg0XVwGfgrK-4F_zmz8vO4hob.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>七样羹</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiho_mpaaenAf7XBAqCVFtjtTPSU.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>片尾丨潮语歌曲《一壶好茶一壶月》----黎田康子</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65819228a1f9e7350052fbea/ltuaJGXlYY960FwYTHKm63buE_kH.m4a" length="41231842" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgmUo7dESC7xHr3_Ech-cwgjRUvR.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
